  "goodToKnow": "Begünstigen means to favour or promote a development (Trockenheit begünstigt Waldbrände) or to give someone an advantage: Die Steuer begünstigt Reiche. Der/die Begünstigte is the beneficiary, of an insurance policy for instance. In criminal law, die Begünstigung is aiding an offender after the crime. From günstig, which means favourable and also cheap: ein günstiges Angebot. Die Vergünstigung is a discount."
